a move and AND gates corresponding to positions at which the 2nd player makes a move.
We give an algorithm that evaluates AND-OR formulas of size T and depth To(1) in this model
with O(T1/2+o(1)) queries. Thus, the quantum speedup is almost the same as in the case when the
formula is known in advance (and only values at the leaves need to be queried) [1, 14], as long as
